obj_table: ['<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8">\n<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">\n<title>ESP32-S3 WiFi</title><style>\nbody{font-family:sans-serif;background:#111;color:#eee;margin:0;padding:24px}\nh1{font-size:20px}label{display:block;margin:14px 0 4px;color:#9ad}\ninput{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #444;background:#1c1c1c;color:#fff;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px}\nbutton{margin-top:20px;width:100%;padding:12px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#2e7d32;color:#fff;font-size:16px}\np{color:#888;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}\nul.nets{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:12px 0}\nul.nets li{padding:12px;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:8px;margin:6px 0;cursor:pointer;background:#1a1a1a}\nul.nets li:active{background:#2a3a2a}\nul.nets li b{color:#fff}ul.nets li i{color:#6a6;font-style:normal;float:right}\nul.nets li.e{color:#666;cursor:default}\nul.nets li.k{border-color:#456;background:#161d24;cursor:default}\nul.nets li.k kbd{font-size:11.5px;color:#8bc;background:#223;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;margin-left:6px;float:right}\nul.nets li.off b,ul.nets li.off i,ul.nets li.off kbd{opacity:.45}\ndetails{margin-top:18px;border:1px solid #333;border-radius:8px;background:#161616}\nsummary{padding:12px;cursor:pointer;color:#9ad;font-size:14px}\n.adv{padding:0 12px 14px}\n.adv p{color:#777}\n.row{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:6px 0}\n.row span{flex:1;color:#9ad;font-size:13px;text-align:center}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px;margin:6px 0}\n.grid input{padding:8px;font-size:14px}\n.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin:6px 0}\n.two label{margin:0;color:#9ad;font-size:13px}\n.two input{padding:8px;font-size:14px}\n.chk{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:10px 0}\n.chk input{width:auto}\n.warn{color:#e6b450;font-size:12.5px}\n</style></head><body><h1>ESP32-S3 WiFi</h1>\n<h2 style="font-size:16px;color:#9ad">已保存网络（按优先级）</h2>\n<ul class="nets">{{SAVED}}</ul>\n<p>点选下方网络（或手动输入）：</p>\n<ul class="nets">{{NETS}}</ul>\n<form method="POST" action="/save">\n<label>WiFi 名称 (SSID)</label><input name="ssid" maxlength="32" required autofocus>\n<label>WiFi 密码</label><input name="pass" type="password" maxlength="64">\n<details><summary>高级设置：引脚（默认 = 出厂接线，改错会没声/没屏）</summary><div class="adv">\n<p class="warn">范围 0-48；26-32 为 Flash 专用禁用。保存后自动重启生效。恢复出厂：长按 BOOT 3s 清配网。</p>\n<div class="chk"><input type="checkbox" id="micon" name="micon" value="1" {{MICON}}><label for="micon" style="margin:0">板载麦克风（取消勾选 = 无麦克风，仅播报/文本模式）</label></div>\n<label>麦克风 INMP441（SCK / WS / SD）</label>\n<div class="grid"><input name="mb" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{MB}}" placeholder="4"><input name="mw" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{MW}}" placeholder="5"><input name="md" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{MD}}" placeholder="6"></div>\n<div class="chk"><input type="checkbox" id="spkon" name="spkon" value="1" {{SPKON}}><label for="spkon" style="margin:0">板载功放（取消勾选 = 无喇叭，仅聆听模式）</label></div>\n<label>功放 MAX98357A（BCLK / LRC / DIN）</label>\n<div class="grid"><input name="sb" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{SB}}" placeholder="1"><input name="sw" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{SW}}" placeholder="2"><input name="sd" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{SD}}" placeholder="3"></div>\n<div class="two"><label>OLED SDA<input name="osda" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{OSDA}}" placeholder="8"></label><label>OLED SCL<input name="oscl" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{OSCL}}" placeholder="9"></label></div>\n<label>OLED 地址</label>\n<select name="oaddr" style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #444;background:#1c1c1c;color:#fff;font-size:16px">\n<option value="60"{{SEL3C}}>0x3C（SSD1306 常见）</option><option value="61"{{SEL3D}}>0x3D</option></select>\n<div class="chk"><input type="checkbox" id="nooled" name="nooled" value="1" {{NOOLED}}><label for="nooled" style="margin:0">本板无 OLED（跳过屏幕初始化）</label></div>\n<div class="two"><label>RGB 灯珠 WS2812<input name="rgb" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{RGB}}" placeholder="48"></label><label>BOOT 按键<input name="boot" type="number" min="0" max="48" value="{{BOOT}}" placeholder="0"></label></div>\n</div></details>\n<button type="submit">保存并重启</button></form>\n<p>保存后设备自动重启并连接 WiFi。<br>\n连上服务器后，屏幕会显示 6 位绑定码：<br>\n请到 <b>www.xiaozhi.me</b> 输入绑定码，把设备绑定到你的账号，然后即可直接语音使用。</p>\n<script>function p(s){document.querySelector(\'[name=ssid]\').value=s;document.querySelector(\'[name=pass]\').focus();}\nfunction del(s){if(confirm(\'删除已保存网络 \'+s+\' ？\')){document.querySelector(\'[name=delsSid]\').value=s;document.querySelector(\'#delf\').submit();}}</script>\n<form id="delf" method="POST" action="/del" style="display:none"><input name="delsSid"></form>\n</body></html>', '<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8">\n<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>OK</title>\n<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="60"></head>\n<body style="font-family:sans-serif;background:#111;color:#eee;padding:24px">\n<h1>已保存</h1>\n<p>设备重启中…请断开此 WiFi。<br>\n开机后按屏幕提示完成绑定即可。</p>\n<p style="color:#666">若设备超过 1 分钟未重启（保存的凭据无法连接），\n<a href="/" style="color:#9ad">点此重新打开配置页</a>。</p></body></html>', 'OVO-%02X%02X', '<li class="e">未发现网络，请手动输入</li>', '<li data-s="%s" onclick="p(this.dataset.s)"><b>%s</b> %s <i>%d</i></li>', '<li class="e">尚未保存网络，请在下方添加</li>', '<kbd>#%d 上次使用</kbd>', '<kbd>已保存</kbd>', '<li data-s="%s" onclick="p(this.dataset.s)"><b>%s</b> %s<span style="float:right;color:#e57" onclick="event.stopPropagation();del(this.parentNode.dataset.s)">✕</span></li>', '<li class="off" data-s="%s" onclick="p(this.dataset.s)"><b>%s</b><span style="float:right;color:#e57" onclick="event.stopPropagation();del(this.parentNode.dataset.s)">✕</span></li>', '[portal] ui:', b'\x81\x80', b'\x00\x00\x00\x00', b'\x00\x01\x00\x00\x00\x00', b'\xc0\x0c\x00\x01\x00\x01\x00\x00\x00<\x00\x04', (192, 168, 4, 1), 'HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nContent-Type: text/html; charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Length: %d\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n', '[portal] deleted network', '[portal] del:', b'', b'\r\n\r\n', b'\r\n', b'content-length:', b':', '[portal] pins rejected:', '[portal] pins saved (%d keys)', 'pins saved, rebooting...', 'wifi setup...', '[portal] saved ssid=%s', 'saved, rebooting...', '[portal] http:', '[portal] stop', 'AP not active after enable', '[portal] starting AP', '[portal] AP try', 'ap start failed', '[portal] AP give up:', 'AP start failed', '[portal] AP %s open, config at http://%s/', '[portal] scan list:', ('0.0.0.0', 53), 0.20000000298023224, ('0.0.0.0', 80)]
